{"version":1,"content":"<p>央視因西甲球會皇家馬德里的法國球星麥巴比「辱毛」停播西甲比賽，西甲主席特巴斯（Javier Tebas）當地時間周一（2日）表示，將盡一切努力平息事態，目前正與中國官方保持溝通，未來將前往中國。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:33.374078+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:43:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.766231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:25.035422+00:00","content_hash":"8026ef00618b2acf2d2caa048f2da6ada9c42624fb4a07b4dd2cfb5193c389aa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}